{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2178","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"H. Create or Duplicate"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"6 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1024 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Santa realized that hand-drawing circles takes too long, so he has turned to magic to meet his production quotas."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are three types of presents with distinct values $$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, and $$$c$$$. Initially, Santa has "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly one"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" present of each type."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given two integers $$$m$$$ and $$$k$$$, representing Santa's favorite number and the cost of duplication, respectively. Santa can cast the following two types of spells any number of times (possibly zero):"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Create — Choose a type of present and create one additional present of that type. This spell costs $$$x$$$ mana, where $$$x\\in \\{a,b,c\\}$$$ is the value of the chosen type. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Duplicate — Choose a type of present and duplicate all presents of that type. This spell costs $$$k$$$ mana. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Santa wants to perform a sequence of spells such that the sum of the values of all presents is a multiple of $$$m$$$ after the spells."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Determine the minimum amount of mana Santa needs to achieve this. It can be shown that, under the given constraints, such a sequence of spells always exists."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of each test case contains five integers $$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, $$$c$$$, $$$m$$$, and $$$k$$$ ($$$1\\leq a \\lt b \\lt c \\lt m\\leq 5\\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$1\\leq k\\leq 5\\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$m$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$5\\cdot 10^5$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$k$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$5\\cdot 10^5$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output a single integer — the minimum amount of mana Santa needs to make the sum of the values of all presents a multiple of $$$m$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n1 2 3 21 4\n3 4 5 12 34\n3 12 14 18 1\n6 7 8 10 3\n100 103 282 488 221\n307 2000 5096 12018 5764